                  <li className=\"flex items-start\">\r\n                        <p className=\"ml-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600 dark300\">\r\n                            Unlimited AI Assistance\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li className=\"flex items-start\">\r\n                        <p className=\"ml-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600 dark300\">\r\n                            Fine-Tuned Story Models\r\n                        </p>\r\n                    </li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n                <div className=\"mt-8\">\r\n                    <a href=\"#\" aria-describedby=\"tier-basic\"\r\n                        className=\"inline-block w-full rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-white shadow-md hover700\">\r\n                        Get started today\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
