s\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n            <div class=\"mt-8\">\r\n                <a href=\"#\" aria-describedby=\"tier-basic\"\r\n                    class=\"inline-block w-full rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-white shadow-md hover:bg-indigo-700\">\r\n                    Get started today\r\n                </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>"
